# Goal
string task_id
string instruction
# vla / map / explore / search / navigate / return_home；空字符串等价 vla
string task_type
float64 target_x
float64 target_y
float64 target_yaw
string target_label
float64 max_duration
bool save_map
float64 target_coverage
---
# Result
bool success
string info
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target_pose
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped approach_pose
float64 confidence
float64 elapsed_sec
---
# Feedback
string progress
string current_intent
string state
float64 explored_ratio
float64 distance_remaining
